WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.414
An OSINT workstation is a dedicated environment for legitimate research using lawfully accessible public information.

00:00:06.414 --> 00:00:09.781
It brings together browsing, documentation, evidence preservation, analysis,

00:00:09.781 --> 00:00:14.411
and reporting while keeping case activity separate from ordinary personal use.

00:00:14.411 --> 00:00:15.673
Separation reduces contamination.

00:00:15.673 --> 00:00:18.199
Personal cookies, saved accounts, autofill, bookmarks,

00:00:18.199 --> 00:00:22.408
and browsing history can confuse research or reveal information unnecessarily.

00:00:22.408 --> 00:00:27.038
A dedicated environment makes it easier to know which settings, artifacts,

00:00:27.038 --> 00:00:29.563
and files belong to the investigation.

00:00:29.563 --> 00:00:32.509
The workstation should support a traceable workflow.

00:00:32.509 --> 00:00:36.297
Analysts need to record requirements, preserve URLs and timestamps,

00:00:36.297 --> 00:00:40.506
organize public documents and captures, distinguish raw collection from analysis,

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:43.874
and produce reports that another reviewer can understand.

00:00:43.874 --> 00:00:48.083
Privacy and evidence handling matter as much as search capability.

00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:51.029
Case material may contain sensitive personal, organizational,

00:00:51.029 --> 00:00:54.396
or technical details even when sources are public.

00:00:54.396 --> 00:00:56.080
Access controls, encryption, retention,

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:59.447
and controlled sharing protect that material from misuse.

00:00:59.447 --> 00:01:03.656
A workstation does not guarantee anonymity, accuracy, or legal authority.

00:01:03.656 --> 00:01:05.340
A VPN, virtual machine,

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:10.811
or separate profile changes technical conditions but does not erase logs, policy, ethics,

00:01:10.811 --> 00:01:11.653
or accountability.

00:01:11.653 --> 00:01:15.862
The environment must reinforce authorized behavior rather than encourage bypasses.

00:01:15.862 --> 00:01:19.650
The goal is a clean and dependable research system.

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:25.122
It should help an analyst answer defined questions, preserve source context, test conclusions,

00:01:25.122 --> 00:01:29.331
and report responsibly without mixing personal activity, collecting unnecessary data,

00:01:29.331 --> 00:01:33.540
or turning tool experimentation into the purpose of the work.
